/**
 * Multiple-choice question bank — Australian Curriculum V9 aligned.
 *
 * Powers: Quick Quiz, Question Generator. (Buzzer Round also drew from
 * this bank until its removal on 2026-07-09.)
 *
 * Coverage target: 4 streams × 5 subjects × ~25 items = ~500 MCQs.
 * Every item carries an `explanation`. Most carry an `acCode` keyed to AC V9
 * (F–10 format `AC9{SUBJ}{YEAR}{STRAND}{NN}`).
 *
 * Streams:
 *   - lower_primary: Foundation–Year 2
 *   - upper_primary: Year 3–Year 6
 *   - middle_school: Year 7–Year 9
 *   - senior_school: Year 10 (the app's scope stops at Year 10)
 *
 * Strand prefix legend (F–10):
 *   English   AC9E{year}{LA|LE|LY}{NN}   LA=Language, LE=Literature, LY=Literacy
 *   Maths     AC9M{year}{N|A|M|SP|ST|P}{NN}
 *   HASS F–6  AC9HS{year}{K|S}{NN}
 *   History   AC9HH{year}{K|S}{NN}        (7–10)
 *   Geography AC9HG{year}{K|S}{NN}        (7–10)
 *   Science   AC9S{year}{U|H|I}{NN}        U=Understanding, H=Human Endeavour, I=Inquiry
 */

